-- Q08 ROOT-CAUSE AUDIT (2026-10-13, pillar reach; owner 2026-10-13: "Audit and remediate all failure modes and root causes", after
-- "q08.org is still publishing banal, vacuous shit"). engine_runs over 7 days: 140 runs, 24 published (all five live on 2026-10-13
-- were 1272-2156 characters and were retracted, q08_retractions reason Q08-QUALITY-RETRACT-1); failures: pruned below floor 22,
-- readers still not worth reading 19, editor draft failed gate 16, other accuracy 15, verdict line 12, lede flagged then revision
-- failed 6, checker unavailable 6. Each root cause below has its fix (q08-signal-engine 0.20.1-0.22.0) and a recurrence detector.
-- Detectors read q08-signal and count failures after the fix's deploy, so they read 0 while the fix holds.
